				}
			],
			"notes": "1. 新增NBT标签数值识别，可在配置界面输入需要统计的NBT标签，支持[ViScriptShop](https://modrinth.com/mod/viscriptshop)；\n2. 自定义计数器支持三种计算模式：仅统计背包物品、仅统计NBT标签、统计背包物品和NBT标签；\n3. 新增计数器图标开关；\n4. 新增季节和游戏日起始天数设置，可在配置界面设置春季的第一天和游戏日的第一天（基于游戏内置天数系统）；\n5. 采用更加合理的配置界面布局。\n---\n1. Adds numerical recognition of NBT tags, which can be entered into NBT tags that need to be counted in the configuration interface, supports [ViScriptShop](https://modrinth.com/mod/viscriptshop).\n2. The custom counter supports three calculation modes: only backpack items, NBT tags only, backpack items and NBT tags.\n3. Adds the option to toggle the counter icon on/off.\n4. Adds season and game day starting days settings, you can set the first day of spring and the first day of game days in the configuration screen (based on the in-game day system).\n5. Adopt a more reasonable configuration interface layout."
		},
