			"notes": "### HUD完整性不再依赖每日运势（Every Single Day）模组！添加独立的季节显示组件，开启后将会根据游戏日切换季节图标（第一个游戏日开始为春季，之后每28天切换一次季节）；优化配置界面逻辑，未加载每日运势模组时能完美还原星露谷物语原版HUD；优化时间组件贴图；适配 Fabric 1.21.1、Forge 1.20.1 以及 NeoForge 1.21.1 版本。\nHUD integrity no longer depends on Every Single Day mod! Add a separate season display component, which will switch the season icon according to the game day after opening it (the first game day starts in spring, and then switches seasons every 91 days); Optimized the configuration interface logic, which perfectly restores the original Stardew Valley HUD when the daily fortune module is not loaded. Optimized the time component map; Adapted to Fabric 1.21.1, Forge 1.20.1 and NeoForge 1.21.1."
